Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F
Ink 1 : Draw 0,0 To 319,199 : Draw 319,0 To 0,199
Ink 2 : Box 10,10 To 100,60
Ink 3 : Bar 120,10 To 200,60
Ink 4 : Circle 260,40,30
Ink 5 : Ellipse 60,130,40,20
Ink 6 : Polygon 150,100 To 200,180 To 100,180 To 150,100
Ink 7 : Plot 300,190 : Plot 301,190
